{"suttaId":"tha-ap355","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"Ap-i","vriCode":"s0510m1.mul","paras":[10490,10498],"vripara":"11"},"segments":{"tha-ap355:0.3":"Kiṃsukapūjakattheraapadānaṃ","tha-ap355:1.1":"“Kiṃsukaṃ pupphitaṃ disvā,","tha-ap355:1.2":"paggahetvāna añjaliṃ;","tha-ap355:1.3":"Buddhaṃ saritvā siddhatthaṃ,","tha-ap355:1.4":"ākāse abhipūjayiṃ.","tha-ap355:2.1":"“Catunnavutito kappe,","tha-ap355:2.2":"yaṃ pupphamabhipūjayiṃ;","tha-ap355:2.3":"Duggatiṃ nābhijānāmi,","tha-ap355:2.4":"buddhapūjāyidaṃ phalaṃ.","tha-ap355:3.1":"“Paṭisambhidā catasso … pe …","tha-ap355:3.3":"kataṃ buddhassa sāsanaṃ”.","tha-ap355:4.1":"Itthaṃ sudaṃ āyasmā kiṃsukapūjako thero imā gāthāyo abhāsitthāti.","tha-ap355:5.1":"Kiṃsukapūjakattherassāpadānaṃ tatiyaṃ."},"unsure":[],"attha":null,"tika":null,"tika2":null}
